  60:/home/reo/Documents/Repository/sca-2026/lib/crypto_kem/hqc128/pqclean/gf.c **** /**
  61:/home/reo/Documents/Repository/sca-2026/lib/crypto_kem/hqc128/pqclean/gf.c ****  * Carryless multiplication of two polynomials a and b.
